{"3770270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Leavers Rift", "steam_appid": 3770270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More than a deckbuilder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Leavers Rift</i></strong>, you travel through a world that is undergoing change, guided by the stories of heroes and companions. Learn what it means to love. Discover new life forms. Examine fossils. Explore your newly awakened feelings that surpass every echo. Study the influences of the mother and the stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/6d5d58ae5631cce1a07d024b38295893.poster.avif?t=1770314725\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/6d5d58ae5631cce1a07d024b38295893.webm?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/6d5d58ae5631cce1a07d024b38295893.mp4?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progressive Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you defeat the final boss of the respective chapter, the game progresses to the next chapter, and so does the world. The difficulty increases and the world reacts to the growing influences of the Leavers Rift. While your journey may begin in an open world full of possibilities, you will soon find yourself climbing mountains or crossing deep gorges. Who knows where your journey will take you next. Only one thing is certain: the Leavers Rift does not want to be crossed...! But you will still try again!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a surreal world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Leavers Rift is an anomaly that puts the fate of your world to the test. Travel through an immersive game world to study the changes up close. Discover quirky limestone formations, novel resources, and non-magical life forms that defy your understanding. Your journey begins in the Twilight Marsh, leads through the Suffering Desert, and ends in the Forest of the Remembrance, where the nature of two deities meets. Will you choose the direct path through the dangerous lands, or will you decide to uncover every remote secret?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play distinctive heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring death and suffering upon your enemies with the metallic <strong>Legionnaire</strong>. Transform your weapon arm to adapt to any situation, whether sword, shield, or the legendary Legionnaire's spear. Depending on the weapon, your actions gain special effects, so use the flexibility wisely. And if your arsenal does not help you further, resort to the rust infection, which resembles a plague in the magical world. Only those who internalize the nature of the Legionnaire will become the personification of conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/6ced48c9a75c5da6791f47edfac79713.poster.avif?t=1770314725\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/6ced48c9a75c5da6791f47edfac79713.webm?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/6ced48c9a75c5da6791f47edfac79713.mp4?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Sun Mantis</strong>, you conjure illusions of yourself and sacrifice a large portion of your cards for powerful effects. But the wisest Sun Mantis raises what is lost from the ashes and even strengthen it, thus forming an endless cycle of burning and rebirth. Enlighten yourself to unlock the powers of the suns and the true nature of your abilities. Master all techniques, and your enemies will go up in flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Jinni</strong>, ensure balance on the battlefield as well as in your deck. Balance self-destructive attacks and healing. Or dare to activate overpowering reserve abilities with minimal life points. But every balance thrives on its circulation. Draw card after card to always find the answer to the most dangerous situations. Master your inner self, and even the gods will learn to respect you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Soul Marionette</strong>'s direct attacks and defenses are very limited, but your enemies will fear you. Create powerful connections to drain life or apply damage-over-time debuffs. Spawn soulless bodies to expand your marionette, and unleash your strongest spell — Unity — causing every connected target (enemy or body) to feel your full strength.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive strange creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/8d48d7a681fb067b70b84f932979db93.poster.avif?t=1770314725\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/8d48d7a681fb067b70b84f932979db93.webm?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/8d48d7a681fb067b70b84f932979db93.mp4?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dangers in Leavers Rift have many faces. Lost souls from species of your world, like the proud Formless, who wants to win every fight in a duel. Or creatures shaped by the influences of the Leavers Rift, like the Gardener, who seems to be neither dead nor alive. Particularly tragic are those creatures that have been washed here from other dimensions and now lead a desolate existence, like the Suffering Rock Screams, trapped in a fate they cannot even comprehend. But most life forms are the beasts and animals that defy the logic of your world, such as the Wingtails, which, through non-magical behavior, can even bring new life forms into the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet fascinating people</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/c68e5da62e197ce9e2a6b52380bf9e28.poster.avif?t=1770314725\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/c68e5da62e197ce9e2a6b52380bf9e28.webm?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/c68e5da62e197ce9e2a6b52380bf9e28.mp4?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only the heroes have been drawn to these realms. The blacksmith seeks unexpected wealth here due to a lack of competition. The little alchemist only ended up here by chance, happy about the juicy hearts that grow in the strange creatures. The shadow crawler, on the other hand, is plagued by a bleak fate that he skillfully hides from you. And the Sacura came here to study the mysteries of this world that the Leavers Rift brought with it. Only those who recognize them as their companions will achieve their personal goal: crossing the Leavers Rift. Who knows what lies behind the magical curtain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leavers Rift is Wolfhain's debut game, powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>