ur enemies will go up in flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Jinni</strong>, ensure balance on the battlefield as well as in your deck. Balance self-destructive attacks and healing. Or dare to activate overpowering reserve abilities with minimal life points. But every balance thrives on its circulation. Draw card after card to always find the answer to the most dangerous situations. Master your inner self, and even the gods will learn to respect you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Soul Marionette</strong>'s direct attacks and defenses are very limited, but your enemies will fear you. Create powerful connections to drain life or apply damage-over-time debuffs. Spawn soulless bodies to expand your marionette, and unleash your strongest spell — Unity — causing every connected target (enemy or body) to feel your full strength.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive strange creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/8d48d7a681fb067b70b84f932979db93.poster.avif?t=1770314725\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/8d48d7a681fb067b70b84f932979db93.webm?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/8d48d7a681fb067b70b84f932979db93.mp4?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dangers in Leavers Rift have many faces. Lost souls from species of your world, like the proud Formless, who wants to win every fight in a duel. Or creatures shaped by the influences of the Leavers Rift, like the Gardener, who seems to be neither dead nor alive. Particularly tragic are those creatures that have been washed here from other dimensions and now lead a desolate existence, like the Suffering Rock Screams, trapped in a fate they cannot even comprehend. But most life forms are the beasts and animals that defy the logic of your world, such as the Wingtails, which, through non-magical behavior, can even bring new life forms into the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet fascinating people</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/c68e5da62e197ce9e2a6b52380bf9e28.poster.avif?t=1770314725\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/c68e5da62e197ce9e2a6b52380bf9e28.webm?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770270/extras/c68e5da62e197ce9e2a6b52380bf9e28.mp4?t=1770314725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only the heroes have been drawn to these realms. The blacksmith seeks unexpected wealth here due to a lack of competition. The little alchemist only ended up here by chance, happy about the juicy hearts that grow in the strange creatures. The shadow crawler, on the other hand, is plagued by a bleak fate that he skillfully hides from you. And the Sacura came here to study the mysteries of this world that the Leavers Rift brought with it. Only those who recognize them as their companions will achieve their personal goal: crossing the Leavers Rift. Who knows what lies behind the magical curtain...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leavers Rift is Wolfhain's debut game, powered by Unreal Engine 5.</p>", "short_description": "Explore the surreal world surrounding the Leavers Rift in this immersive roguelike deckbuilder. Build powerful decks, collect treasures, and lose yourself in a story about humanity in a realm of magic. Uncover the influenc